# XYZ mode uses DBAP. Compare with 02: this interpolates a physical position.
# Packed p[423>111] = three digits per XYZ endpoint, 0..9 -> -1..1.
# Exact centre: p[x 0 0 0]. p[-1 0 1] still means a sequential pan.
!t[Three trajectories]
!spk[000 900 909 009]
!vs
s220v0>1>0'10e0p[423>111]
t330v0>0.6>0'10e0p[x -1 0 -1]>[x 1 0 1]
a440v0>0.3>0'10e0f3>8p[x 0 -1>1 0]
